       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 3000 mg three times daily comes to 9,000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 3,000 mg is also well above the usual maximum of 1,000 mg per dose.\n- **Risk:** A dose this high risks serious hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1,000 mg by mouth three times daily** (3,000 mg/day)\n- **650 mg by mouth every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day)\n- **1,000 mg by mouth every 6 hours** (4,000 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **3,000 mg total per day**, which would be 1,000 mg three times daily\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want the original 3,000 mg three times daily, please confirm that explicitly. I'd still suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
